  "classification": {
    "rootCause": "code-bug",
    "summary": "The V4 implementation's transfer accounting reused the sender's pre-transfer balance for both sides of a self-transfer, so transfer(account, balanceOf(account)) doubled that account's recorded THOREUM balance. The campaign repeatedly doubled small acquired balances and sold the unsupported tokens into the THOREUM/WBNB pair. Whether this implementation was an accidental project upgrade or attacker-installed through a compromised privileged key remains unresolved and blocks cohort admission."
  },
